.npmrc
# These two hold no secret: they carry the literal string ${NPM_TOKEN}, which npm
# expands from the environment when it reads the file. Both are required build
# inputs -- each server's Dockerfile COPYs its .npmrc before `yarn install`.
!mcp-servers/dappier-seller-server/.npmrc
!mcp-servers/reporting-server/.npmrc
